{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Cross","description":"Alex Cross is a brilliant but flawed homicide detective and full of contradictions. A doting father and family man, Cross is single-minded to the point of obsession when he hunts killers. He is desperate for love, but his wife’s murder has left him too damaged to receive it.\n\nRated TV-MA · Returning Series · First aired 14 Nov 2024 · United States · Language: English\nStudio: Skydance Television, Amazon MGM Studios, Paramount Television Studios · Network: Prime Video\n\nNot complete. On your server: S1 8/8 | S2 not on server\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","genres":["Crime","Drama","Mystery","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Hero Complex","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Washington, D.C. Detective Alex Cross is called to solve the case when a Black Lives Matter activist is killed in cold blood.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jvVr3tR6ITxhb2LzR6jVoKtqL70.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Ride the White Horsey","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Emir Goodspeed's murder spreads like wildfire through D.C., catching others in its burn, while D.C.-powerbroker Ed Ramsey seduces his next victim: an art aficionado named Shannon Witmer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vEEGD2uoTOR0qnEzyfVMe2pKbG7.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.3","title":"The Good Book","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Cross raids a home connected to Emir's murder. The suspect escapes, but leaves behind a piece of evidence so unique, it limits the list of suspects to an elite D.C. few.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A1vbGogJ0wVnYLRiS9SSswIlyPd.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Masks","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With Cross hot on his heels, Ed Ramsey sets up a new locale to perform his kills, as the Cross family continues to be tormented by a mysterious someone connected to Deirdre Nolan.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1DkRla6Nnqbqi1UDrK3E0qzkv2i.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"What Happens at Ramsey's","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Cross and Elle dine at Ed Ramsey's house for his annual birthday soiree. But the night's twists take a dark turn, when Cross realizes that Ramsey's next victim is in the house.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/alhxU9PW8GTLmgX364unVoLkWBD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"A Bang, Not a Whimper","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A fresh lead sends Cross to Philly with his son Damon. Along the way, father and son reconnect through the shared grief over Maria's death.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ne2wjVrh28vDTbEpKmnvVbT6iEr.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0Nyb3NzJTIwJTI4MjA0JTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Happy Birthday","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Cross closes in on Ed Ramsey as the clock desperately ticks down to the moment when Shannon Witmer is set to die. Will Cross make it in time?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zcj4h3BYDgfSTKEq93qKE9ZoeHA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW